Add `spring-cloud-starter-netflix-eureka-client` and configure `spring.application.name=user-service`. Also ensure `@EnableDiscoveryClient` (or just add the starter which auto‑enables it).

Add `spring-cloud-starter-openfeign` and `spring-cloud-starter-netflix-eureka-client`.

```java
@FeignClient(name = "user-service")
public interface UserClient {
    @GetMapping("/users/{id}")
    User getUser(@PathVariable("id") Long id);
}

@RestController
@RequestMapping("/orders")
public class OrderController {
    private final UserClient userClient;

    public OrderController(UserClient userClient) {
        this.userClient = userClient;
    }

    @GetMapping("/{userId}")
    public String getOrderForUser(@PathVariable Long userId) {
        User user = userClient.getUser(userId);
        return "Order for " + user.getName();
    }
}
```

Enable Feign clients with `@EnableFeignClients` in the main class.
